<title>USA: Key Democrat says US budget accord &quot;awfully close&quot;.</title>
<headline>Key Democrat says US budget accord &quot;awfully close&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The senior Democrat on the House Budget Committee said on Friday that budget negotiations are continuing and expressed optimism that an agreement between Congress and the White House could be reached soon.</p>
<p>&quot;It is still a work in progress but we are getting awfully close,&quot; Rep John Spratt of South Carolina told Reuters as he entered closed-door talks.</p>
</text>
